out.push(S('Stage 7R · Share'));
out.push(A('Count the four moves across every transcript in the room. The hand-back is missing from most of them, and the discussion to have is not about politeness: ask what the person being interviewed does when the hand-back never comes. The answer the class gives is "they stop", and they are right.'));
out.push(S('Homework (sample)'));
out.push(SAMPLE(['Three minutes with my mother about the pharmacy, marked from memory: four echoes, one reaction, one question, no hand-back, because she handed it back herself after about two minutes — she asked whether I was going to carry on with the English. My count surprised me. I thought I asked a lot of questions and I asked one. The echoes did the work and I did not know I was using them until I wrote it down this evening.']));

